eligibility.criteria:
Inclusion criteria:

* Type 2 diabetes with duration \> 6 months and age over 20;
* sufficient manual dexterity and visual acuity;
* willingness to wear two CGM devices and perform BG tests for 7 days.

Exclusion criteria:

* untreated proliferative retinopathy;
* untreated mental illness that precludes study adherence
* untreated cardiovascular disorder such as unstable angina, severe heart failure,
* infectious diseases such untreated hepatitis, HIV, or active Covid-19;
* other severe body system disease.
